        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal of heat dissipation system with radiator</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal of heat dissipation system with radiator
Disposal of components for the heat dissipation system;
UUID: 4295d353-16ab-4dce-a486-818b0c3960cd
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on average input from different call of bids for the heating system used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4295d353-16ab-4dce-a486-818b0c3960cd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
